{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24108","headline":"题天竺南院赠闲元旻清四上人 · 白居易","name":"题天竺南院赠闲元旻清四上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杂芳涧草合，繁绿岩树新。\n山深景候晚，四月有余春。\n竹寺过微雨，石迳无纤尘。\n白衣一居士，方袍四道人。\n地是佛国土，人非俗交亲。\n城中山下别，相送亦殷勤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}